# files in CI.
!neobim-ifc-service/tests/fixtures/sample_briefs/*.txt
*_SUMMARY.md
*_REPORT.md
*_COMPLETE.md
*_CHECKLIST.md
*_GUIDE.md
*_PLAN.md
